WEBVTT

00:10:29.996 --> 00:10:32.996
in these other populations who are at highest risk:

00:10:32.996 --> 00:10:34.996
drug injectors, sex workers

00:10:34.996 --> 00:10:36.996
and gay men.

00:10:36.996 --> 00:10:38.996
And you'll note, that's the local data from Los Angeles:

00:10:38.996 --> 00:10:41.996
25 percent prevalence among gay men.

00:10:42.996 --> 00:10:45.996
Of course, you can't get HIV just by having unprotected sex.

00:10:45.996 --> 00:10:48.996
You can only HIV by having unprotected sex

00:10:48.996 --> 00:10:51.996
with a positive person.

00:10:51.996 --> 00:10:53.996
In most of the world,

00:10:53.996 --> 00:10:55.996
these few prevention failures

00:10:55.996 --> 00:10:57.996
notwithstanding,

00:10:57.996 --> 00:10:59.996
we are actually doing quite well these days

00:10:59.996 --> 00:11:01.996
in commercial sex: